    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885350/extras/7fdb8c651dad0c0bfaf388b933fc897d.poster.avif?t=1741167984\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885350/extras/7fdb8c651dad0c0bfaf388b933fc897d.webm?t=1741167984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885350/extras/7fdb8c651dad0c0bfaf388b933fc897d.mp4?t=1741167984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Avoid tricky obstacles like deadly spikes, secret doors, spinning gates, and objects falling from the sky - getting a perfect hit into the hole can be dangerous!</strong><br><br>Beware of the twisty road speed ramp, which makes your coin go super fast! Only those with true mastery can skillfully control their coin as it hurtles down the track!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885350/extras/76ee4e43bf92538bf525b91ad774a97e.poster.avif?t=1741167984\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885350/extras/76ee4e43bf92538bf525b91ad774a97e.webm?t=1741167984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885350/extras/76ee4e43bf92538bf525b91ad774a97e.mp4?t=1741167984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in a world of fun and variety. Put on different funny skins, collect coins as you roll down, and strive to complete as many levels as possible in this never-ending game. Each level brings a new challenge and a chance to showcase your skills!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Avoid various tricky obstacles and reach the coin machine!<br></li><li>Gain points as you roll down the twisty road<br></li><li>Beware of the twisty road speed ramps! It'll make your coin roll so fast that you'll need to be a pro to control it and get it into the hole!<br></li><li>Complete plenty of levels which are progressively more difficult<br></li><li>Change the skin of your coin<br></li><li>Test your focus and exact precision!</li></ul><br>Ready to roll?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885350/extras/7fdb8c651dad0c0bfaf388b933fc897d.poster.avif?t=1741167984\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885350/extras/7fdb8c651dad0c0bfaf388b933fc897d.webm?t=1741167984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885350/extras/7fdb8c651dad0c0bfaf388b933fc897d.mp4?t=1741167984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Avoid tricky obstacles like deadly spikes, secret doors, spinning gates, and objects falling from the sky - getting a perfect hit into the hole can be dangerous!</strong><br><br>Beware of the twisty road speed ramp, which makes your coin go super fast! Only those with true mastery can skillfully control their coin as it hurtles down the track!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885350/extras/76ee4e43bf92538bf525b91ad774a97e.poster.avif?t=1741167984\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885350/extras/76ee4e43bf92538bf525b91ad774a97e.webm?t=1741167984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885350/extras/76ee4e43bf92538bf525b91ad774a97e.mp4?t=1741167984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in a world of fun and variety. Put on different funny skins, collect coins as you roll down, and strive to complete as many levels as possible in this never-ending game. Each level brings a new challenge and a chance to showcase your skills!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Avoid various tricky obstacles and reach the coin machine!<br></li><li>Gain points as you roll down the twisty road<br></li><li>Beware of the twisty road speed ramps! It'll make your coin roll so fast that you'll need to be a pro to control it and get it into the hole!<br></li><li>Complete plenty of levels which are progressively more difficult<br></li><li>Change the skin of your coin<br></li><li>Test your focus and exact precision!</li></ul><br>Ready to roll?",
